    "title": "Jack\u2019d - Gay Chat & Dating",
    "description": "With over 15 million people in 2,000 cities and 180 countries, we\u2019re proud to be the largest dating app for QPOC.\r\n\r\nJack\u2019d is an independent, LGBTQ+ owned and operated company, and we use the app we build. We believe in the power of technology to create community and to connect with each other. Whether you\u2019re looking to chat, make friends, find love, or keep it casual, you\u2019ll find it on Jack\u2019d.\r\n\r\n<b>MAKE REAL CONNECTIONS</b> \r\n\u2022 15+ million users, no spambots\r\n\u2022 Find exactly the people you like with search and filters\r\n\u2022 View, wave at, and chat with people from around the world\r\n\u2022 Jack'd Match connects you with the people you like\r\n\u2022 Click \"I'm Interested\" on a profile and Jack'd will let you know if there's a mutual attraction\r\n\r\n<b>EXPRESS YOURSELF</b>  \r\n\u2022 Share your story with multiple profile pics, rich profiles, private albums, hashtags, and more\r\n\u2022 Let others know what you\u2019re into with profile details like sex preferences and safer-sex practices\r\n\u2022 Comprehensive pronoun and gender identity options put you in control of your identity\r\n\r\n<b>A SMARTER, SAFER EXPERIENCE</b>  \r\n\u2022 24/7 support for our community, including in-app links to our Safety Center\r\n\u2022 We never share your data with 3rd party ad networks or data aggregators like Google or Facebook\r\n\u2022 Message history, photos, and videos sync across your devices and never get lost\r\n\r\n<b>VERIFIED PROFILES</b>  \r\n\u2022 Let others know you're real by verifying your profile photos\r\n\u2022 Complete the process in seconds and receive a verification badge on your profile\r\n\u2022 Know whose photos are real by looking for the badge on other profiles\r\n\r\n<b>VIDEO CHAT</b>  \r\n\u2022 A fun and sexy way to get to know each other before you meet\r\n\u2022 Prefer to keep it virtual? Video chat has you covered\r\n\r\n<b>MATCH</b>  \r\n\u2022 Every day, Jack'd Match shows you a new stack of profiles who are looking for people like you\r\n\u2022 Swipe left to pass, right if you\u2019re interested - if it\u2019s a match, we\u2019ll let you both know\r\n\u2022 Choose \u201cAsk later\u201d if you\u2019re not sure about them, and we\u2019ll show them again tomorrow\r\n\r\nQuestion? Comments? We\u2019re available any time at support.jackd.com.\r\n\r\nJack\u2019d Privacy Policy: https://www.jackd.com/privacy\r\nJack\u2019d Terms of Service: https://www.jackd.com/tos",
    "descriptionHTML": "With over 15 million people in 2,000 cities and 180 countries, we\u2019re proud to be the largest dating app for QPOC.<br><br>Jack\u2019d is an independent, LGBTQ+ owned and operated company, and we use the app we build. We believe in the power of technology to create community and to connect with each other. Whether you\u2019re looking to chat, make friends, find love, or keep it casual, you\u2019ll find it on Jack\u2019d.<br><br><b>MAKE REAL CONNECTIONS</b> <br>\u2022 15+ million users, no spambots<br>\u2022 Find exactly the people you like with search and filters<br>\u2022 View, wave at, and chat with people from around the world<br>\u2022 Jack&#39;d Match connects you with the people you like<br>\u2022 Click &quot;I&#39;m Interested&quot; on a profile and Jack&#39;d will let you know if there&#39;s a mutual attraction<br><br><b>EXPRESS YOURSELF</b>  <br>\u2022 Share your story with multiple profile pics, rich profiles, private albums, hashtags, and more<br>\u2022 Let others know what you\u2019re into with profile details like sex preferences and safer-sex practices<br>\u2022 Comprehensive pronoun and gender identity options put you in control of your identity<br><br><b>A SMARTER, SAFER EXPERIENCE</b>  <br>\u2022 24/7 support for our community, including in-app links to our Safety Center<br>\u2022 We never share your data with 3rd party ad networks or data aggregators like Google or Facebook<br>\u2022 Message history, photos, and videos sync across your devices and never get lost<br><br><b>VERIFIED PROFILES</b>  <br>\u2022 Let others know you&#39;re real by verifying your profile photos<br>\u2022 Complete the process in seconds and receive a verification badge on your profile<br>\u2022 Know whose photos are real by looking for the badge on other profiles<br><br><b>VIDEO CHAT</b>  <br>\u2022 A fun and sexy way to get to know each other before you meet<br>\u2022 Prefer to keep it virtual? Video chat has you covered<br><br><b>MATCH</b>  <br>\